          ],
        },
        {
          id: 'billing',
          title: '4. Plans, billing, and taxes',
          paragraphs: [
            'Paid plan features, billing periods, currency, taxes, renewal terms, and the seller for a transaction are shown before purchase. A plan may limit registered devices, Relay concurrency, traffic, rate, or regions.',
            'Any purchase made through Apple or Google is also subject to that store provider\'s payment and refund rules.',
          ],
        },
        {
          id: 'cancellation',
          title: '5. Cancellation and refunds',
          paragraphs: [
            'You may cancel automatic renewal through the service or store where you subscribed. Unless checkout states otherwise, cancellation takes effect at the end of the current paid period.',
            'Refunds are handled under applicable law, the checkout terms, and the relevant merchant or app-store process. These terms do not limit mandatory consumer rights.',
          ],
        },
        {
          id: 'availability',
          title: '6. Availability and changes',
          paragraphs: [
            'We work to keep managed services available but do not promise uninterrupted operation or a service level unless a separate written agreement says so. Networks, endpoint availability, third-party infrastructure, maintenance, and security incidents can affect connectivity.',
            'We may change or retire features and plans. We will provide reasonable notice of material changes affecting an active paid plan when practicable.',
          ],
        },
        {
          id: 'data',
          title: '7. Your data and privacy',
